    "source": "/Volumes/EXTERNAL/自媒体/AI博主1000视频研究-20261007/指定5账号近两月-20261009/media/7675692879856047801.mp4",
    "sourceKind": "local",
    "durationSec": 361.418,
    "width": 1080,
    "height": 1920,
